WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.075
The dangers.

2
00:00:01.075 --> 00:00:05.338
A class one run skipped would look
resolved, so unauthorized writes

3
00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:09.525
would vanish the night the audit
read fails; the refusal stops that.

4
00:00:09.525 --> 00:00:12.064
A resolved finding must
never close a record,

5
00:00:12.064 --> 00:00:15.975
because drift can leave the
measurement without leaving the estate.

6
00:00:15.975 --> 00:00:20.887
Pushing every finding every night fills
the tracker, so push only what's new.

7
00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:24.212
The first month's burst
isn't failure; triage it.

8
00:00:24.212 --> 00:00:28.237
Guests and the HR source's own
accounts are excluded as noise.

9
00:00:28.237 --> 00:00:33.220
And an HR extract is personal data:
keep it where HR data is allowed.
